    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new desktop companion!<br>This <strong>cute and cozy virtual cat pet</strong> lives right on your Windows desktop \u2014 playfully roaming, napping, and interacting with you while you work, browse, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're typing up documents or watching videos, your pet cat keeps you company in a charming <strong>overlay experience</strong> that never gets in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686200/extras/f567b5392f9b7ecc3128423d29efd7ef.avif?t=1747755024\" width=569 height=105 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable desktop overlay cat</strong> that lives outside the game window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed, pet, and play</strong> with your cat using simple interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always-on experience</strong> that runs while you do other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distraction-free \u2014 like a virtual buddy, not a full-screen app.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely <strong>customize</strong> your cat\u2019s look with accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Monitor</strong> support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants a little happiness on their screen at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2757 <strong>Windows OS only</strong>\u2757</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new desktop companion!<br>This <strong>cute and cozy virtual cat pet</strong> lives right on your Windows desktop \u2014 playfully roaming, napping, and interacting with you while you work, browse, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're typing up documents or watching videos, your pet cat keeps you company in a charming <strong>overlay experience</strong> that never gets in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686200/extras/f567b5392f9b7ecc3128423d29efd7ef.avif?t=1747755024\" width=569 height=105 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable desktop overlay cat</strong> that lives outside the game window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed, pet, and play</strong> with your cat using simple interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always-on experience</strong> that runs while you do other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distraction-free \u2014 like a virtual buddy, not a full-screen app.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely <strong>customize</strong> your cat\u2019s look with accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Monitor</strong> support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants a little happiness on their screen at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2757 <strong>Windows OS only</strong>\u2757</p>",
